{"channelId":"UCg-98on-4ND-R6wEij9cv1Q","row":["The Kind Canine",15100,"Welcome! My name is Erica Pashia and I am the owner and head trainer for The Kind Canine. I am a certified dog trainer (ABCDT) and have raised and worked with many wonderful dogs throughout the course of my life. From an early age, I was fascinated and intrigued by animals and animal behavior as a whole. When I rescued my first dog as an adult - who also came to me with several behaviors of concern - I became fully entrenched in dog training strategies, philosophies and how to better communicate with my new canine companion, thus beginning my journey as a professional dog trainer!\n#AvantLink","thekindcaninepetservices@gmail.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg-98on-4ND-R6wEij9cv1Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg-98on-4ND-R6wEij9cv1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:49.345Z","channelId":"UCg-98on-4ND-R6wEij9cv1Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f357433c263cf25507ef6b407b9164173e2518f2ceb0e28a77f3bbe30b9e7178","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1cf343e703b4671c505c3aa6a1655cb99ef926f4ce58e4a06a12a638236e5086"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg-98on-4ND-R6wEij9cv1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:49.345Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg-98on-4ND-R6wEij9cv1Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":15100,"raw":"15.1K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg-98on-4ND-R6wEij9cv1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:49.345Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"thekindcaninepetservices@gmail.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://www.thekindcaninepetservices.com/contact"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:2cc6d6fbbd1f68595f0987cb"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T13:37:42.471Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: theki